[center][size=6][b]Eve (Stellar Blade) v1.2.0[/b][/size]
Six outfits in one CSS mod[/center]

[size=4][b]Added[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Six selectable outfit variants: Black Pearl, Prototype Planet Diving Suit, Skin Suit, Vacation Bikini, Casual Knitwear and Midsummer Alice.
[*]Original appearance plus at least five clothing color palettes per outfit.
[*]Outfit-specific clothing toggles and color controls, with separate body and hair customization.
[*]Body-shape sliders and adjustable hair, chest, glute, thigh and belly motion across all six variants.
[*]Clothing motion for Prototype's back tail, Casual Knitwear and Midsummer Alice's ribbon tails.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Changed[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Combine the outfit trials into one CSS_EveStellarBlade_eins0fx_P package.
[*]Use the new Eve portrait thumbnail.
[*]Name the existing Eve idle option Eve Default Idle.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Fixed[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Improve clothing fit, chest coverage, skin weights and deformation on the included outfits.
[*]Keep each outfit's dye textures separate when switching variants.
[*]Preserve the accepted hand, camera, movement and body-proportion fixes.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Upgrading[/b][/size]
Requires Custom Shell System (CSS). Close the game before replacing mod files.

Remove the old CSS_EveStellarBlade_eins0fx_P folder before copying the new folder into MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/.

If you installed private fitting trials, also remove these folders to avoid duplicate Eve entries:
[list]
[*]CSS_EveFit14_P
[*]CSS_EveSkinFit16_P
[*]CSS_EveBikiniFit1_P
[*]CSS_EveKnitFit4_P
[*]CSS_EveAliceFit3_P
[/list]

The download contains one matching .pak, .ucas and .utoc trio. Keep all three files together. Previous trial selections may need to be selected again under Eve (Stellar Blade).

[i]Minor clipping can remain in extreme poses or body-shape settings. Holiday Reveler, War Aegis and the planned 14 additional idle animations are not included in this release.[/i]
